[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15008.07, "timestamp": "04:10:08", "text": "それってキャラクター設定のことですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15009.91, "timestamp": "04:10:09", "text": "つまり、それがキャラクターを効率的に集める方法だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15012.469, "timestamp": "04:10:12", "text": "愛に忠実でない人は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15014.63, "timestamp": "04:10:14", "text": "愛の神の名において。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15016.71, "timestamp": "04:10:16", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15019.269, "timestamp": "04:10:19", "text": "キャラクターのレベルを上げる必要があるし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15023.03, "timestamp": "04:10:23", "text": "武器。私は全く損害を与えていません。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15025.75, "timestamp": "04:10:25", "text": "各キャラクター、いや、敵について考えてみてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15029.429, "timestamp": "04:10:29", "text": "元素システムを持つ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15032.309, "timestamp": "04:10:32", "text": "VuvaやGenshinに似ている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15035.269, "timestamp": "04:10:35", "text": "火、水、弱さのようなもの"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15041.605, "timestamp": "04:10:41", "author": "@miko_chann.1", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/pA1qKxvA6gJkJo5iacL6MoaaocqRqPaKMbOHlznwOHpCJPPZbIU3_GNZ4faHtUzgYCNGbiZs1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oh btw i needed a help if u don't mind"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15043.03, "timestamp": "04:10:43", "text": "あれ。ええ、私は考えなければなりません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15045.99, "timestamp": "04:10:45", "text": "それを行うことについて。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15047.67, "timestamp": "04:10:47", "text": "ところで、もしあなたが助けてくださらないなら、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15057.365, "timestamp": "04:10:57", "author": "@miko_chann.1", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/pA1qKxvA6gJkJo5iacL6MoaaocqRqPaKMbOHlznwOHpCJPPZbIU3_GNZ4faHtUzgYCNGbiZs1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg"}]